{
  "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T22:54:12.148Z",
  "count": 17,
  "snapshots": [
    {
      "date": "2026-07-31",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-31.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "我不甘心，明明你为我做了那么多，我却什么都不能为你做。",
        "from": "四月是你的谎言",
        "author": "",
        "type": "动画",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-30",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-30.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "山远天高烟水寒，相思枫叶丹。",
        "from": "长相思·一重山",
        "author": "李煜",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-29",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-29.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "今天你最后遇见的那个人有在微笑吗？",
        "from": "幸运星",
        "author": "",
        "type": "动画",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-28",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-28.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "愿有朝一日与你见面还能释放温暖拥你入怀。",
        "from": "境界的彼方",
        "author": "",
        "type": "动画",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-27",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-27.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "最后我还想再拜托你一件事，希望你可以把我忘掉。",
        "from": "末日时在做什么？有没有空？可以来拯救吗？",
        "author": "珂朵莉·诺塔·瑟尼欧里斯",
        "type": "动画",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-26",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-26.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "酒逢知己千杯少，话不投机半句多。",
        "from": "明贤集·七言集",
        "author": "",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-25",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-25.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "今夜不知何处宿，平沙万里绝人烟。",
        "from": "碛中作",
        "author": "岑参",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-24",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-24.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "换我心，为你心，始知相忆深。",
        "from": "诉衷情·永夜抛人何处去",
        "author": "顾夐",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-23",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-23.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "当我忘了你的时候，我就忘了我自己。",
        "from": "呼啸山庄",
        "author": "",
        "type": "文学",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-22",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-22.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "人是悬挂在自己编织的意义之网上的动物。",
        "from": "文化的阐释",
        "author": "克利福德·格尔茨",
        "type": "哲学",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-21",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-21.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "有志者，事竟成。",
        "from": "后汉书·耿弇传",
        "author": "",
        "type": "哲学",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-20",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-20.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "人到情多情转薄，而今真个不多情。",
        "from": "山花子·风絮飘残已化萍",
        "author": "纳兰性德",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-19",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-19.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "诗万首，酒千觞，几曾着眼看侯王？",
        "from": "鹧鸪天·西都作",
        "author": "朱敦儒",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-18",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-18.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "我今虽永逝，一语贻后贤；天国祚虽斩，复生待他年。",
        "from": "绝命诗",
        "author": "洪仁玕",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-17",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-17.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "想当年，金戈铁马，气吞万里如虎。",
        "from": "永遇乐·京口北固亭怀古",
        "author": "辛弃疾",
        "type": "诗词",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-16",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-16.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "正因为有忘也忘不了的回忆，才会变得坚强，这就是所谓的成长吧！",
        "from": "火影忍者",
        "author": "",
        "type": "动画",
        "source": "hitokoto"
      }
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-15",
      "file": "data/snapshots/2026-07-15.json",
      "quote": {
        "text": "认识你自己。",
        "from": "德尔斐神谕",
        "author": "苏格拉底",
        "type": "哲学",
        "source": "local"
      }
    }
  ]
}
